description:
In this role, you will be responsible for identifying new opportunities with agencies, fostering lasting partnerships, and managing multiple responsibilities simultaneously. Additionally, this position requires proactive communication, problem-solving skills, business development, and support in organizing events for agency clients. Your work will directly contribute to business and revenue growth by strengthening connections within the B2B space.
This is a remote role requiring candidates to be based in or near London, with the ability and willingness to travel throughout the UK and Europe as needed to foster partner relationships and support regional growth initiatives.
Key Responsibilities
Agency Relationship Management:

• Act as the primary contact for B2B agencies, addressing their needs and ensuring a seamless experience;

• Foster strong, long-term relationships that contribute to agency retention and satisfaction;

• Provide ongoing support to agencies to maximize their success with our services;

• Proactively craft compelling content to present to agencies in terms of insight-led research (e.g. as part of a lunch and learn session).

Business Development & Outreach:

• Conduct outreach efforts to establish connections with potential B2B agencies and generate new opportunities;

• Expand our network by identifying and securing partnerships with new agencies;

• Develop strategies to drive growth within existing agency relationships;

• Collaborate with the EMEA sales team to co-manage agency opportunities (e.g., responding to RFIs and briefs).

Event Coordination & Support:

• Assist in planning and executing events such as in-person meetings, webinars, and networking sessions for agency clients;

• Work closely with internal teams to ensure events are well-organized and align with business goals;

• A significant part of this role is meeting with agency clients face-to-face in London for events and networking sessions. There may also be meetings face-to-face in other parts of the UK and abroad in Europe as part of the role.

Strategic Growth & Market Research:

• Conduct research to identify industry trends and potential partners, contributing to targeted outreach strategies;

• Collaborate with agencies to explore new opportunities and expand service offerings within existing accounts.

Ongoing Client Engagement & Support:

• Provide follow-up communications to ensure agency satisfaction and uncover additional partnership opportunities;

• Assist senior team members in daily activities, supporting overall business objectives.

• Collaborate closely with internal Sales and Client Success Teams to provide and present campaign insights, optimization opportunities, and enablement pre, during, and post campaign

Additional Qualifications:

• Ability to manage multiple agency accounts and projects simultaneously;

• Experience in client success. Hospitality experience is a plus;

• Experience in demand generation in a B2B context;

• Experience leveraging AI in current role;

• Strong interpersonal and communication skills to establish and maintain relationships;

• Proficiency in CRM software and other client management tools;

• Excellent organizational skills and attention to detail;

• A proactive, self-motivated approach to problem-solving;

• Experience in event planning is a plus;

• Ability to collaborate effectively across teams;

• Customer-focused mindset with strong analytical skills;

• Willingness and flexibility to travel across the UK and Europe to support local agency partnerships, events, and business development initiatives as needed

Remote work note: Where applicable, remote work must be conducted from your home office located in a jurisdiction in which DEMAND.com has the legal right to operate.
